WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.064
Built for ninety days.

00:02.764 --> 00:06.499
Opportunity was built to last ninety Martian days.

00:06.949 --> 00:14.291
It drove forty-five kilometres in more than fourteen years, and found rocks that could only have formed in water.

00:14.741 --> 00:18.997
A dust storm that covered the whole planet ended it in 2018.
